@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false


[*] --> LandingPage

' ================= PUBLIC ENTRY =================
LandingPage --> Authenticating : Sign In / Sign Up
LandingPage --> CommunityBrowsing : View Community Plans
LandingPage --> InviteReview : Open Invite Link

' ================= AUTH =================
Authenticating --> Dashboard : Success
Authenticating --> LandingPage : Failed / Cancel

' ================= DASHBOARD =================
Dashboard --> NewPlanForm : Create Travel Plan
Dashboard --> CommunityBrowsing : View Community Plans
Dashboard --> InviteReview : Open Invite Link
Dashboard --> LandingPage : Sign Out

' ================= PLAN CREATION =================
NewPlanForm --> ValidatingTrip : Submit Trip Details
ValidatingTrip --> GeneratingPlan : Valid details + credits
ValidatingTrip --> NewPlanForm : Invalid dates / no credits
GeneratingPlan --> GeneratedPlan : Plan saved
GeneratingPlan --> NewPlanForm : AI / save failed

' ================= PLAN WORKSPACE =================
GeneratedPlan --> RefiningPlan : Refine Plan
RefiningPlan --> GeneratedPlan : Refine success
RefiningPlan --> GeneratedPlan : Refine failed / no credits

GeneratedPlan --> EditingItinerary : Edit itinerary
EditingItinerary --> GeneratedPlan : Save / Cancel

GeneratedPlan --> CollaborationPanel : Manage collaborators
CollaborationPanel --> GeneratedPlan : Close panel
CollaborationPanel --> InvitePending : Send invite
InvitePending --> CollaborationPanel : Invite sent
InvitePending --> CollaborationPanel : Invalid invite / limit reached
CollaborationPanel --> CollaborationPanel : Revoke invite / access

GeneratedPlan --> ExpenseTracker : Open expenses
ExpenseTracker --> GeneratedPlan : Save / Back

GeneratedPlan --> Settings : Open settings
Settings --> GeneratedPlan : Save settings
Settings --> PlanDeleted : Delete plan
PlanDeleted --> Dashboard : Back to dashboard

GeneratedPlan --> Publishing : Publish plan
Publishing --> Published : Publish success
Publishing --> GeneratedPlan : Publish failed / cancel
Published --> GeneratedPlan : Unpublish plan

GeneratedPlan --> LandingPage : Sign Out

' ================= SHARED PLAN FLOW =================
InviteReview --> Authenticating : Sign in required
InviteReview --> SharedPlan : Accept invite
InviteReview --> LandingPage : Invalid / expired invite
SharedPlan --> EditingItinerary : Edit shared itinerary
SharedPlan --> ExpenseTracker : View or update expenses
SharedPlan --> LandingPage : Sign Out

' ================= COMMUNITY FLOW =================
CommunityBrowsing --> CommunityReadOnlyPlan : Open plan
CommunityReadOnlyPlan --> CommunityBrowsing : Back
CommunityBrowsing --> LandingPage : Back
CommunityBrowsing --> LandingPage : Sign Out

@enduml
